# --- Binary data & model artefacts (defensive, by extension) -----------------
# The directory rules above already cover today's data. These extension rules are
# the safety net for data that lands somewhere new: they are what stops a stray
# raster or checkpoint from being committed before anyone notices.
# NOTE: *.csv and *.csv.gz are deliberately NOT here — the tracked model inputs
# (soil, management, weather) use exactly those.
#
